IF YOU REDISTRIBUTE ARTEMIS, READ THIS FIRST

Artemis performs no login and stores no credential. Its sign-in flow ends in the
provider CLI's own login, run by the user in their own terminal.

Anthropic's Agent SDK documentation states that third-party developers may not
offer claude.ai login or subscription rate limits for their products without
prior approval from Anthropic. Artemis's sign-in flow ends in exactly that login.
If you distribute a build of Artemis to other people, seek that approval first.

Running your own build against your own subscription is a separate matter from
distributing one to others.

